#: ../../source/docs/common-ark-fpv.rst:344
#: cf13b5cd1dc3416fab9f6c8b47efe1bc
msgid "RC input is configured on the RX6 (UART6_RX) pin. It supports all RC protocols except PPM. See :ref:`Radio Control Systems <common-rc-systems>` for details for a specific RC system. :ref:`SERIAL6_PROTOCOL<SERIAL6_PROTOCOL>` is set to “23”, by default, to enable this."
msgstr ""

